{
  "slug": "sentinal-stack",
  "name": "Sentinal Stack",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "10 specialized agents that embed DLP, EU AI Act compliance, and real-time audit evidence into your AI workflows — so compliance happens automatically, not after the fact.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `ai-governance` (AI risk classification and governance skill), `audit-trail` (Compliance audit log generator), `caveman` (Token-efficient communication mode), `compliance-evidence` (Compliance artifact generator), `decision-audit` (Governance decision validation skill), `dlp-engine` (3-tier DLP (Data Loss Prevention) scoring engine that combines pattern scanning, industry classifiers, and behavioral baselines into a…), `first-principles` (Structured problem decomposition tool), `guardrails` (Data governance and compliance guardrail), and 4 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sentinal-stack@claude-community` from `aadityaparab/sentinel-stack`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
